Composition. The MPMC shall be headed by the Mindanao
Development Authority (MinDA), with the following as menibers:
Department of Energy (DOE);
@fice of the Brestbent of the 39himoines

Energy Regulatory Commission (ERC);
National Electrification Administration (NEA);
National Power Corporation (NC); and
Power Sector Assets and Liabilities Management Corporation (PSALM).
The representatives of the Mindanao Electric Power Alliance (MEPA) and
Association of Mindanao Rural Electric Cooperatives (AMRECO) are likewise
enjoined to become members of the MPMC.
